
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/crm

### ==================================================================
### Test 1: Check Admin role
### ==================================================================

# @name getCustomersByAdmin
GET {{baseUrl}}/Customers
Authorization: Basic admin:
### Result: 200 OK. categoryGroup is counted


### ==================================================================
### 👤Test 2: Check Sales Manager role
### ==================================================================

# @name getCustomersByManager
GET {{baseUrl}}/Customers
Authorization: Basic manager:
### Result: 200 OK.

### Add interactions by manager
# @name createInteractionByManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/Interactions
Authorization: Basic manager:
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_ID": "12fa7731-b782-4078-bb3f-588869eb5fe0",
    "method_code": "O",
    "summary": "Customer purchased a new RPG game in the shop"
}
### Result: 201 Created.


