### ==================================================================

# @name getCustomersByAgent
GET {{baseUrl}}/Customers
Authorization: Basic agent:
### Result: 200 OK.

### Add interactions
# @name createInteractionByAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/Interactions
Authorization: Basic agent:
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_ID": "12fa7731-b782-4078-bb3f-588869eb5fe0",
